              "expression": "// Two variable definitions\nconst conc = OLI.random(0.1,0.800,2);\nconst concsf = conc .toPrecision(2);\nconst k = 4.4e-7; \nvar x = 0;\n\n\nfor (let step = 0; step < 10; step++) {\n  x = Math.sqrt(k*(conc-x));\n}\nconst h = x .toPrecision(2);\nconst ph = -Math.log10(x) .toPrecision(3);\nconst phsf = ph .toPrecision(3);\nconst phlow = 0.99*ph;\nconst phhigh = 1.01*ph;\n\n// Expose variables to OLI\nmodule.exports = {\n  conc, concsf, x, h, ph, phsf, phlow, phhigh\n};\n",
